invariant: INV-61
file: x509.c
catches: diff_x509_mldsa
reason: the CA walk hands ML-DSA-87 the TBSCertificate less its last
  byte, so every signature check fails and an accepted chain is
  refused. Spec.X509's parse .mldsa verifies the whole TBS with its
  header, and bin/diff_x509_mldsa's accept rows find the two verdicts
  apart.

--- old
    signed_out->tbs_len = left_at_tbs - rb_left(&r);
--- new
    signed_out->tbs_len = left_at_tbs - rb_left(&r) - 1;
